	chapter_group.56606D9D3313A77F.title: "The Journey"
	file.0000000000000001.title: "Building Tales 2"
	quest.00548947C0F2A76A.quest_desc: ["After you obtain this bee, it is up to you to decide which bee you obtain next, based on which digital storage mod you go after!"]
	quest.00548947C0F2A76A.title: "Obtain the Diamond Bee!"
	quest.02CD5A42C9CE2214.quest_desc: ["You can't be a builder if you don't have what you need in order to craft tools to gather other types of resources!"]
	quest.02CD5A42C9CE2214.quest_subtitle: "The First Material a Builder Needs!"
	quest.02CD5A42C9CE2214.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.03FFEA55B5C29AE9.quest_desc: ["Need to find a structure? In this pack, there is an item called a &aStructure Compass&r! This item does exactly what you think it does, finds structures you search for, like a Nature's Compass, which finds biomes!"]
	quest.05E3A43B325730D5.quest_desc: ["If you're looking to get into &aProductive Bees&r, you'll need some &6Sturdy Bee Cages&r! Which can be found in &9Villages&r. Also, plan to obtain &eVanilla Bees&r as well for regular honey!"]
	quest.05E3A43B325730D5.quest_subtitle: "I Can't Bee-lieve it!"
	quest.061B563B9B719AF4.quest_desc: ["The &eBee Nest Helmet&r will prevent you from being attacked from angry bees!"]
	quest.0B7A3873FBCF7E4C.title: "Autocrafting!"
	quest.0D0414FBA87C92F4.quest_desc: ["&aCloche Domes&r can be used on Basic and Advanced Planters! It boosts growth speed and yield! It can also be stacked with fertilizer to make it more efficient!"]
	quest.0E6D66CA75573EB7.quest_desc: ["Crafting a &5Novice Spell Book&r is the first step to honing your magic skills! Your spells can help you with your common tasks, such as breaking blocks and much more!"]
	quest.0E6D66CA75573EB7.quest_subtitle: "You're a Wizard!"
	quest.0E6D66CA75573EB7.title: "Welcome to Ars Nouveau!"
	quest.14E46E368805C898.title: "Obtain the Coal Bee!"
	quest.1AD8C2C1A58C51EF.quest_desc: ["With &aCrafts and Additions&r in the pack, you can turn your &6SU into RF/FE&r!"]
	quest.1C8D5ACC3CC06207.quest_desc: ["This upgrade increases &6yield&r and it has &bthree tiers&r! You can hold shift while hovering your mouse over the item to see how much each tier increases it by, as this one increases &eyield by 10%&r. But, &cdecreases speed by 5%&r."]
	quest.1E262CB4761C170D.quest_desc: ["Welcome to &eProductive Bees&r! In this chapter you will learn how to obtain the essential bees needed for materials that are in most modded recipes!"]
	quest.1E262CB4761C170D.title: "Welcome to Productive Bees!"
	quest.1FE36BF44CFC5B3F.quest_desc: ["Perform the &5Ritual of Awakening&r and throw a &eBook and Quill&r before right clicking the &6Ritual Brazier&r to activate the ritual."]
	quest.20750A5073592A78.quest_desc: ["With &aSophisticated Backpacks&r, you are able to carry more building materials and explore more when your inventory is full! The best part is that you can upgrade your backpack and even craft a &eStack Upgrade&r, which allows you to hold &n&lmore than&r&r 64 blocks per stack!"]
	quest.20750A5073592A78.quest_subtitle: "Storage on-the-go!"
	quest.20750A5073592A78.title: "Sophisticated Backpacks"
	quest.24708B1D2293C578.quest_desc: ["With &eConstruction Sticks&r in this pack, you can make building an easier and more efficient task! Check your &bkeybinds&r as it can tell you what these tools can do!"]
	quest.271ADE8E715694E6.title: "Refined Storage 2"
	quest.2DABE602258DF330.title: "Obtain the Osmium Bee!"
	quest.30F5D337392DA297.title: "Obtain the Redstone Bee!"
	quest.32B9FE66EAF1AFDF.quest_desc: ["Use the &bNest Locator&r to find certain types of bees you will need to obtain other types of bees later on!"]
	quest.348191D9F109386C.quest_desc: ["The &aBiomass Burner&r can be used to generate RF/FE for the Advanced Planter and Machines that require power!"]
	quest.38D8D083EC6BF72C.quest_desc: ["WIP"]
	quest.3A2387D48529EF93.title: "Obtain the Obsidian Bee!"
	quest.3B3567BBBD3188B7.quest_desc: ["The &aAdvanced Planter&r can be used once you are ready to grow your resources quicker and once you have a solid choice for generating power!"]
	quest.3B952591D9ED48C8.quest_desc: ["The &5Ritual Brazier&r will be used for a lot of things, such as &bsummoning bosses&r!"]
	quest.3E0FA7DB1F955153.quest_desc: ["With &bFTB Ultimine&r in the pack, you can use the &eGRAVE&r key or &l&n&e`&r&r&r key in order to vein mine trees, ores, crops, and more!"]
	quest.3E0FA7DB1F955153.quest_subtitle: "The Greatest Skip Button"
	quest.3E0FA7DB1F955153.title: "There's Veinmining in this pack?!?"
	quest.3E17011145DA2EF2.title: "Obtain the Steel Bee!"
	quest.3ECA3623311E59C0.quest_desc: ["This quest will unlock &dChapter 3&r! In that chapter, you'll be able to decide between &3Refined Storage 2&r and &5Applied Energistics 2&r!"]
	quest.3FD58E66B0BA4970.title: "Obtain the Fluix Bee!"
	quest.4601D85CB8331201.title: "Another Storage Option"
	quest.472A26B2B4EB03BE.quest_desc: ["With &2Functional Storage&r, you are able to store items and upgrade it. Which is useful for certain farms!"]
	quest.472A26B2B4EB03BE.title: "Storage that is Functional!"
	quest.497A308A52517593.quest_desc: ["The &eScribe's Table&r is used to create &n&lGlyphs&r&r that can be used to create &aadvanced spells&r! With higher tier Glyphs requiring you to have a better spell book."]
	quest.4B35253A17F268B3.quest_desc: ["This upgrade increases &6processing speed&r and it has &bthree tiers&r! You can hold shift while hovering your mouse over the item to see how much each tier increases it by, as this one increases &eprocessing speed by 10%&r. But, &cincreases how much power is used by 10%&r."]
	quest.4C36A777E7B43D29.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to &6Building Tales 2&r! In this pack, you get to use Vanilla and Modded resources to create the build of your dreams! &eHorses&r are buffed in this modpack, so it is the most recommended way to get around in the overworld when you are not building! There are plenty of &bstructures&r to find and explore so best of luck!"
		""
		"The quests will serve as a &n&cguideline&r&r as it has no effect on progression!"
	]
	quest.4C36A777E7B43D29.quest_subtitle: "A Builder's Dream Pack"
	quest.4F04E1600148EEF1.quest_desc: ["Looking for resources for a build? If so, use a &aNature's Compass&r, this item can help you locate a biome you may want to go to for resources that could take hours to find if this item didn't exist!"]
	quest.4F04E1600148EEF1.quest_subtitle: "A Builder's Best Friend"
	quest.4F04E1600148EEF1.title: "Need Resources?"
	quest.51D04FE91EFA4633.quest_desc: ["With &6Sophisticated Storage&r, you are able to upgrade your chests and allow them to have more space for building resources!"]
	quest.520CBEA2C5D69D80.quest_desc: ["This sourcelink uses lava to obtain source."]
	quest.528BB799E60445F2.quest_desc: ["If you want to find items from &aCreate: Ratatouille&r, search &z@ratatouille&r in EMI."]
	quest.554029C93EAD865E.title: "Obtain the Spatial Bee!"
	quest.57CE0442A8B3BBA1.title: "Obtain the Copper Bee!"
	quest.583BE974BCEFFAA4.title: "Applied Energistics 2"
	quest.591BE87BD680F6DC.quest_desc: ["Welcome to &aAgriTech: Evolved&r! This mod is one of the ways you can farm resources! It has integrations with mods such as; Croptopia, Ars Nouveau, Mystical Agriculture, Farmer's Delight, and more! But, Mystical Agriculture crops are disabled to be used in these planters in this pack."]
	quest.591BE87BD680F6DC.title: "Welcome to AgriTech: Evolved!"
	quest.594C68A769829716.title: "Basic Smelting"
	quest.5AEDC798EEFC3447.title: "Obtain the Quartz Enriched Iron Bee!"
	quest.5BD20955D852CA02.quest_desc: ["Welcome to &5Chapter 3&r! In this chapter you'll be deciding on which Digital Storage you want to use and use the quests as a guide to get through these mods!"]
	quest.5CF9E371F170FCE0.quest_desc: ["Obtain the &6Iron Bee&r and gather it's combs! It can be processed in a &eCentrifuge&r, this applies to the quests ahead of this one as well!"]
	quest.5CF9E371F170FCE0.title: "Obtain the Iron Bee!"
	quest.5EFCF296FD1BED97.quest_desc: ["When you run out of &dSturdy Bee Cages&r, you will need to craft &6Bee Cages&r in order to continue your search and breeding of the bees!"]
	quest.61D01F7CCEF7CDD1.quest_desc: ["A &eBreeding Chamber&r will make getting certain types of bees easier instead of depending on RNG to give you the bee you seek. This quest will unlock &dChapter 2&r!"]
	quest.61D01F7CCEF7CDD1.quest_subtitle: "Say No to RNG!"
	quest.6592C64CFE2E0905.quest_desc: ["With &aFTBChunks&r in this pack, you can claim and force load chunks if needed! &cClick M&r then &9click C&r in order to open the GUI to claim chunks!"]
	quest.6592C64CFE2E0905.title: "Claiming Chunks!"
	quest.6638269A7C0500E6.quest_desc: ["Andesite Alloy is the first step on getting on started with Create! You'll need more than 8 so be prepared to make more."]
	quest.6638269A7C0500E6.title: "Welcome to Create!"
	quest.6BBF20CAC5745EB4.quest_desc: ["Use &9Lapis&r or &#AF4AFFAmethyst&r in order to obtain Source Gem!"]
	quest.6D2E806CFE35D6EC.quest_subtitle: "Revolutionary!"
	quest.6D2E806CFE35D6EC.title: "Crafting on the go?!?"
	quest.74AA74CC819EC4C1.quest_desc: ["&6Advanced Beehives&r allow you to do everything a regular one can do, but you don't need shears or campfires anymore! These beehives can be expanded with an &aExpanision Box&r!"]
	quest.74AA74CC819EC4C1.title: "Craft an Advanced Beehive!"
	quest.74F41C0CD6D951A5.title: "Obtain the Ender Bee!"
	quest.75919ED0C3A5A89D.quest_desc: ["With &dXaero's&r in this pack, you can create waypoints by clicking &6B&r whenever you don't have a backpack equipped! You can manage your waypoints by clicking &bU&r whenever you want to hide or delete one."]
	quest.76200A194A736236.title: "All The Presses"
	quest.7628DAC4F317089F.quest_desc: ["In order to fill a &9Source Jar&r, you must place a &aSourcelink&r on top of the Jar. The quests above are the two most recommended Sourcelinks to use!"]
	quest.7663986FBB35EDE5.quest_desc: ["With &7Iron Furnaces&r, you are able to craft faster and more efficient furnaces!"]
	quest.779D8A18AAC4EC14.title: "Obtain the Gold Bee!"
	quest.78476C0C43E876FA.quest_desc: ["Just like I've done, your inventory has to be full by now. Craft a chest and empty your inventory and backpack if you have one!"]
	quest.78476C0C43E876FA.title: "Basic Storage"
	quest.7855D1764B1572B6.quest_desc: ["This one uses the growth of crops to obtain source."]
	quest.7B51A0C7C0631EC2.quest_desc: ["With &aEasy Villagers&r, you can manage villagers without having to build a vanilla iron farm or breeder. With this, craft an &eAdvanced Beehive&r from &aProductive Bees&r and a Trader then place the villager and the beehive in there as that will serve as the alternative way to obtain Sturdy Bee Cages as long as you craft the standard ones to trade with."]
	quest.7B51A0C7C0631EC2.title: "Easy Villagers"
	quest.7C3619852D139F18.quest_desc: ["The &6Compostor&r will be the key for obtaining &9Mulch&r which is needed for crafting &aInfused Farmland&r, which grants 100% growth speed as Mulch grants 50%!"]
